      "fact": " This is causing the Eurasian Plate to deform, and the Indian Plate to compress at a rate of 4 cm/yr (1.  == Political geography == India is divided into 28 States (further subdivided into districts) and 8 union territories including the National capital territory (i.  India's borders run a total length of 15,200 km (9,400 mi).  Its borders with Pakistan and Bangladesh were delineated according to the Radcliffe Line, which was created in 1947 during Partition of India.  Its western border with Pakistan extends up to 3,323 km (2,065 mi), dividing the Punjab region and running along the boundaries of the Thar Desert and the Rann of Kutch.  This border runs along the Indian states and union territories of Ladakh, Jammu and Kashmir, Punjab, Rajasthan, and Gujarat.  Both nations delineated a Line of Control (LoC) to serve as the informal boundary between the Indian and Pakistan-administered areas of the Kashmir region"
