      "subSubject": "",
      "emoji": "",
      "question": "The plant began production in _____ with an SUV model specifically designed for the Indian market",
      "answer": "2019",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " The facility is the company's first manufacturing plant in India.  Kia stated that it would hire 3,000 employees for the plant, and it would produce 300,000 cars annually.  Construction of the plant began in mid-2017 and has been completed in March 2019.  The plant began production in 2019 with an SUV model specifically designed for the Indian market.  Kia president Han-Woo Park announced that the first model produced at the plant would be an SUV(sport utility vehicle) specifically designed for the Indian market.  Park also added that Kia would invest over $2 billion and create 10,000 jobs in India by 2021.  === Automobile components === Hitachi announced an auto-component plant in Chennai by 2016 with an increase in their India employees count from 10,000 to 13,000"
    },
