      "hint": "",
      "fact": " After the Arab Spring of 2011, with ousting of Hosni Mubarak, Egypt asked for the help of India in conducting nationwide elections.  Gabon Gabon maintains an embassy in New Delhi.  The Embassy of India in Kinshasa, Democratic Republic of Congo is jointly accredited to Gabon.  Ghana Both countries established diplomatic relations on 6 March 1957.  Relations between Ghana and India are generally close and cordial mixed with economic and cultural connections.  Trade between India and Ghana amounted to US$818 million in 2010–11 and is expected to be worth US$1 billion by 2013.  Ghana imports automobiles and buses from India and companies like Tata Motors and Ashok Leyland have a significant presence in the country"
