      "fact": " In 2010, Prime Minister David Cameron described Indian – British relations as a \"New Special Relationship\".  == See also == Women of the Indian independence movement K.  Nursey album == Notes == == References == === Citations === === Sources and further reading === Yadav, B.  Acharya: Reminiscences of an Indian Revolutionary.  == Further reading == == External links == Media related to Indian independence movement at Wikimedia Commons Quotations related to Indian independence movement at Wikiquote"
