      "answer": "Girish Kasaravalli",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " India has produced many cinema-makers like S. Rajamouli, Satyajit Ray, Mrinal Sen, J.  Viswanath, Ram Gopal Varma, Bapu, Ritwik Ghatak, Guru Dutt, Adoor Gopalakrishnan, Shaji N.  Karun, Girish Kasaravalli, Shekhar Kapoor, Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Nagraj Manjule, Shyam Benegal, Shankar Nag, Girish Karnad, G.  Iyer, Mani Ratnam, and K.  Balachander (see also: Indian film directors).  With the opening up of the economy in recent years and consequent exposure to world cinema, audience tastes have been changing"
    },
    {
      "id": "q1814",
      "type": "fill_blank",
      "category": "Art & Culture",
