      "answer": "Indian Railways",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " With a workforce of 1. 31 million people, the IR is also one of the country's largest employers.  The railways is a major contributor to jobs, GDP, and mobility.  Indian Railways has decided to revise its 2022–23 rolling stock production plan upwards.  The Ministry's new plan targets the production of 8,429 units for the coming financial year.  Production for 2022–23 has been raised by 878 units from the earlier planned 7,551, according to the revised targets.  Indian Railways has targeted to manufacture 475 new Vande Bharat trainsets for the next four years as a part of its modernization plan"
