      "question": "UAE, US, and _____ were the top sources of remittances to India, while Bangladesh, Pakistan, and Nepal were the top recipients of remittances from India",
      "answer": "Saudi Arabia",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " === Remittances === In 2015, a total of US$68. 91 billion was made in remittances to India from other countries, and a total of US$8. 476 billion was made in remittances by foreign workers in India to their home countries.  UAE, US, and Saudi Arabia were the top sources of remittances to India, while Bangladesh, Pakistan, and Nepal were the top recipients of remittances from India.  Remittances to India accounted for 3. 32% of the country's GDP in 2015.  === Mergers and acquisitions === Between 1985 and 2018 20,846 deals have been announced in, into (inbound) and out of (outbound) India"
    },
