      "answer": "South Korea The",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " North Korea India and North Korea have growing trade and diplomatic relations.  India had a fully functioning embassy in Pyongyang which was closed down due to COVID-19 pandemic in the host country while North Korea still operates an embassy in New Delhi.  India has said that it wants the \"reunification\" of Korea.  South Korea The cordial relationship between the two countries extends back to 48AD, when Queen Suro, or Princess Heo, travelled from the kingdom of Ayodhya to Korea.  According to the Samguk Yusa, the princess had a dream about a heavenly king who was awaiting heaven's anointed ride.  After Princess Heo had the dream, she asked her parents, the king and queen, for permission to set out and seek the man, which the king and queen urged with the belief that god orchestrated the whole fate.  Upon approval, she set out on a boat, carrying gold, silver, a tea plant, and a stone which calmed the waters"
    },
    {
      "id": "q3318",
      "type": "fill_blank",
      "category": "International Relations",
      "region": "",
      "source": "Wiki",
      "pubDate": "2026-06-28T13:02:20.908Z",
