      "answer": "Space Power",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Antrix opposed the Devas plea for tribunal award in the Delhi High Court.  == See also == Space industry of India Antrix Corporation NewSpace India Limited IN–SPACe Indian Space Association Defence Space Agency Space Based Survelliance project Deep Ocean mission Indian Institute of Space Science and Technology Launch vehicles of ISRO List of Indian satellites List of ISRO missions Science and technology in India National Space Science Symposium == Notes == == References == == Bibliography == == Further reading == The Economics of India's Space Programme, by U.  Sankar, Oxford University Press, New Delhi, 2007, ISBN 978-0-19-568345-5 The Indian Space Programme, by Gurbir Singh, Astrotalkuk Publications, ISBN 978-0956933737 Reach For the Stars: The Evolution of India's Rocket Programme, by Gopal Raj, ISBN 978-0670899500 From Fishing Hamlet to Red Planet: India's Space Journey, by ISRO, ISBN 978-9351776895 Brief History of Rocketry in ISRO, by P.  Radhakrishnan, ISBN 978-8173717642 India's Rise as a Space Power, by U.  Rao, ISBN 978-9382993483 == External links == Official website \"Official website of the Department of Space of the Government of India\""
