      "fact": " Many national-level football club are based in this state, such as Mumbai Tigers FC, Kenkre FC, Bengal Mumbai FC, and Air India FC.  Two clubs from the state participate in Elite Football League of India.  Mumbai Gladiators and Pune Marathas are teams based in Mumbai and Pune respectively.  Puneri Paltan, U Mumba, Pro Kabbadi, league teams are based in Pune and Mumbai respectively.  == Tourism == Maharashtra has a number of places that attracts national and international tourists.  The most popular or well known are Mumbai city, Ajanta, Ellora caves and the Nature reserves in the state.  Ajanta–Ellora are the UNESCO World Heritage Sites"
