      "subSubject": "Books & Authors",
      "emoji": "",
      "question": "Raskhan (_____–1628), a major figure of the bhakti (devotional) movement",
      "answer": "1548",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Mirabai (1504–1560), author of Mira Padavali etc.  Tulsidas (1532–1623), author of Ramacharitamanas, Vinay Patrika etc.  Keshavdas (1555–1617), author of Rasikpriya etc.  Raskhan (1548–1628), a major figure of the bhakti (devotional) movement.  Banarasidas (1586–1643) who is known for his poetic autobiography - Ardhakathānaka, (The Half Story).  Bihari (1595–1664) became famous by writing Satasai (Seven Hundred Verses).  Bhushan (1612–1713), author of Shivabavani, Chhatrasal Dashak etc"
    },
