      "hint": "",
      "fact": " == Genres of Hindi literature == === Poetry === Hindi has a rich legacy of poetry.  There are several genres of poetry based on Ras, Chhand and Alankar (e. , Shringar, Karun, Veer, Hāsya, etc.  Hasya Kavita is humorous comic poetry in Hindi.  It is particularly famous due to Hindi Kavi sammelans and TV shows.  Bal kavita is children's rhymes in Hindi.  Many attempts have been made to document Hindi poetry"
