      "fact": " There are several genres of poetry based on Ras, Chhand and Alankar (e. , Shringar, Karun, Veer, Hāsya, etc.  Hasya Kavita is humorous comic poetry in Hindi.  It is particularly famous due to Hindi Kavi sammelans and TV shows.  Bal kavita is children's rhymes in Hindi.  Many attempts have been made to document Hindi poetry.  Some of the most comprehensive online collections for Hindi poetry include Kavitakosh and Kavita"
