      "hint": "",
      "fact": " An Indian Administrative Service (IAS) officer can also be appointed as deputy governor of RBI and later as the governor of RBI as with the case of Y.  Venugopal Reddy and Duvvuri Subbarao.  Other persons forming part of the central board of directors of the RBI are Satish Kashinath Marathe, Swaminathan Gurumurthy, Anand Gopal Mahindra, Venu Srinivasan, Pankaj Ramanbhai Patel, Ravindra H.  Executive Directors (ED) consist of Vivek Deep, Radha Shyam Rathao, Ajay Kumar, Neeraj Nigam, P.  Laxmi Kanth Rao, Arnab Kumar Chowdhury, Charulatha S.  Kar, Ajit Ratankar Joshi, Sajay Kumar Hansda, Indranil Bhattacharya, Kesavan Ramachandran, Sonali Sen Gupta, Usha Jankiraman and Sudha Balakrishnan (Chief Financial Officer).  Sudha Balakrishnan, a former vice-president at National Securities Depository Limited, assumed charge as the first chief financial officer (CFO) of the Reserve Bank on 15-May-2018; she was given the rank of an executive director"
