      "pubDate": "2026-06-28T13:06:26.939Z",
      "subject": "RBI Press Releases",
      "subSubject": "RBI Press Releases",
      "emoji": "",
      "question": "Key tools in this effort include _____ such as agriculture, micro and small enterprises (MSE), housing and education",
      "answer": "Priority Sector Lending",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " === Developmental role === The central bank has to perform a wide range of promotional functions to support national objectives and industries.  The RBI faces a lot of inter-sectoral and local inflation-related problems.  Some of these problems are results of the dominant part of the public sector.  Key tools in this effort include Priority Sector Lending such as agriculture, micro and small enterprises (MSE), housing and education.  RBI work towards strengthening and supporting small local banks and encourage banks to open branches in rural areas to include large section of society in banking net.  === Custodian to foreign exchange === The Reserve Bank has custody of the country's reserves of international currency, and this enables the Reserve Bank to deal with crisis connected with adverse balance of payments position.  === CSD for G-Sec (government securities) === Public Debt Office (PDO) acts as CSD (Central Securities Depository) for G-Sec"
    },
